          "summary": "<p>财新网08月28日电: 沪指开盘报3950.24点，跌幅0.16%。</p><p>深成指报14019.28点，跌幅0.21%；创业板指报3453.73点，跌幅0.57%；中小板指报8647.85点，跌幅0.13%。</p><p>盘面上，计算机领涨，传媒、基础化工、石油石化、有色金属、农林牧渔等板块涨幅居前，电力设备领跌，综合、电子、医药生物、通信、公用事业等走弱。</p><p>消息面上，商务部回应美考虑对华额外加征7.5%关税；多地政策密集发力稳楼市，为“金九银十”蓄势；王毅26日会见美国驻华大使庞德伟时表示，在两国元首领航掌舵下，双方正在推动构建中美建设性战略稳定关系；宇树科技上市后股价冲顶持续回落，27日收盘较上市首日开盘价跌近44.1%；1—7月，工业企业利润同比增长17.6%；英伟达本财年二季度营收达962.21亿美元，同比增106%。</p><p>撰写：财小智   责编：财小新</p><div class=\"yqzszb\" id=\"yqzszb\"><div class=\"header\"><div class=\"yqzszb-title\"><strong><span>上市公司敏感舆情指数</span></strong><img alt=\"数据+\" class=\"support\" src=\"https://entities.caixin.com/support.png\" /></div><p><em class=\"update-time\">更新时间：2026-08-28</em></p></div><div class=\"yqzszb-list\"><div class=\"list-header\"><div class=\"order\">排名</div><div class=\"others\"><div class=\"stock\">股票</div><div class=\"index\">今日指数</div><div class=\"comp\">较昨日</div></div></div><ul class=\"yqzszb-lists\"><li><a href=\"https://stock.caixin.com/m/stock/details/101001437\"><div class=\"row-order\">1</div></a><div class=\"row-content\"><a href=\"https://stock.caixin.com/m/stock/details/101001437\"><div class=\"row-table\"><div class=\"row-info\"><div class=\"name cell\">海尔智家<p><span class=\"stock-no\">600690.SH</span></p></div><div class=\"price cell\">16.68</div><div class=\"rate cell\"><span class=\"price-up\">+16.68</span></div></div></div><div class=\"yqzszb-info\">海尔智家(06690.HK)：吴勇及黄德成辞任副总裁职务</div></a></div></li><li><a href=\"https://stock.caixin.com/m/stock/details/101018430\"><div class=\"row-order\">2</div></a><div class=\"row-content\"><a href=\"https://stock.caixin.com/m/stock/details/101018430\"><div class=\"row-table\"><div class=\"row-info\"><div class=\"name cell\">中金公司<p><span class=\"stock-no\">601995.SH</span></p></div><div class=\"price cell\">14.14</div><div class=\"rate cell\"><span class=\"price-up\">+14.14</span></div></div></div><div class=\"yqzszb-info\">中金公司“三合一”重组获上交所审核通过</div></a></div></li><li><a href=\"https://stock.caixin